WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Here is the question. Explain three safe ways to store chemicals.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.000
Let's learn the answer. There are three safe ways.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.000
Way one. Check the Safety Data Sheet for storage requirements.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.400
Way two. Keep the chemical in its original container.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.200
Way three. Label the container with hazard warning signs.

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Remember. Read the Safety Data Sheet,

7
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.500
keep the original container, label with hazard signs.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.000
Well done Caleb!
